WEBVTT

00:01:58.072 --> 00:02:01.450
because we really live every day
as if it were our last,

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:04.829
and that’s in the best
and the worst kind of ways.

00:02:06.038 --> 00:02:09.417
I think this is where
the screenwriter in me was born:

00:02:09.417 --> 00:02:11.043
at home in Lebanon,

00:02:11.043 --> 00:02:12.628
in the streets at home

00:02:12.628 --> 00:02:14.505
and the house I grew up in,

00:02:14.505 --> 00:02:19.343
because I became fascinated
with human flaws and vulnerabilities

00:02:19.343 --> 00:02:23.139
and the truth that comes out of us
in times of crisis

00:02:23.139 --> 00:02:24.765
and when we’re put under pressure.

00:02:25.224 --> 00:02:26.851
And when at home,

00:02:26.851 --> 00:02:28.769
when I saw the people I loved the most,

00:02:28.769 --> 00:02:29.896
my parents,

00:02:29.896 --> 00:02:30.897
be real,